        "answer": 0,
        "why": "The Removal Effect R_k = (P_base - P_without_k) / P_base isolates the structural indispensability of channel k by quantifying the drop in conversion probability when all transitions through k are redirected to drop-off.",
        "answerIndex": 0,
        "explanation": "The Removal Effect R_k = (P_base - P_without_k) / P_base isolates the structural indispensability of channel k by quantifying the drop in conversion probability when all transitions through k are redirected to drop-off."
